# Agent contract — Memory Forge v0.8.1

Current entry: docs/CURRENT.md. Current design: docs/design_v0.8.1.md (24 anchored chapter sources). Runtime and data remain the reviewed0.7 lineage; target design is not implemented by version label.

1. Read docs/decisions_v0.8.1.md and the current/target flags before edits.
2. Work in a separate branch/worktree. One Unity scene/prefab editor lease; MCP read tasks do not grant production access.
3. Cross-review with the other agent. Never claim tests, compilation, Unity, devices, DB, payments or deployment without fresh evidence.
4. Preserve private repo intent. Do not expose production credentials or real user data. Production write/deploy/payment requires human approval.
5. Keep prices, gacha, permanent asset semantics and character ages within explicit approved scope; routine implementation may proceed autonomously.
6. Edit docs/source_v0.8.1 and rebuild with npm run docs. All23chapters,10sheets and50prompts must survive. Numbered character headings are not chapter boundaries.
7. Run npm test, npm run test:proposals, Python tests, npm run test:docs. No failed inventory may be called a complete delivery.
8. Latest checksums: MANIFEST_v0.8.1.json and MANIFEST.sha256. Historical files under docs/archive and old manifest versions are not current.
9. memory_v2 is independent and unconnected. FullRun/HTML/server/migration acceptance is required before changing its state.
